4:9 ; of idols (do not hear) 115:6 ; 135:17 ; בא ׳שָׁמַע 2Sam 7:22 8 t.; especially ׳בְּא after verb of saying = in the ears, in the hearing of Gen 20:8 (E) 23:10 , 13 , 16 (P) 44:18 ; 50:4 (J) Deut 5:1 ; 31:11 , 28 , 30 44t.; compare Isa 5:9 (verb omitted); after noun of utterance, sound 1Sam 15:14 ; Job 13:17 ; 15:21 ; compare ׳א after verbal noun Ezek 24:26 ( א ׳לְהַשְׁמָעוּת ) compare Isa 11:3 ; א ׳הִטָּה incline the ear = give attention Psa 45:11 ; Prov 22:17 9 t.; followed by ל Psa 49:5 4 t.; so א ׳הִקְשִׁיב Isa 32:3 ; Prov 2:2 (followed by ל ); א ׳הֵבִיא ׳ל 23:2 ; as receiving words ׳א תָּקַּח Job 4:12 compare Jer 9:19 ; as tingling ( צלל ) at dreadful news 1Sam 3:11 ; 2Kin 21:12 ; Jer 19:3 ; as hearing with satisfaction, triumph Psa 92:12 אָזְנָי֑ תִּשְׁמַעְנָה (|| בְּ עֵינִי ׳וַתַּבֵּט but Che strike out; as intelligent (involving mental process) א ׳שָֽׁמְעָה לָהּ וַתָּבֶן Job 13:1 ; ׳א תִּבְחָ֑ן מִלִּין 12:11 ; compare 34:3 ; as unsatisfied Eccl 1:8 א תִמָּלֵא ׳לֹא מִשְּׁמֹעַ ; as seeking ( בקשׁ ) know-ledge Prov 18:15 ; as hearing & blessing Job 29:11 ; compare ׳א שֹׁמַעַת Prov 20:12 ; 25:12 a hearing (responsive, obedient) ear ; compare 15:31 ; Isa 43:8 ; opposed to stopping the ears (wilful ignorance) א ׳אֹטֵם מִןֿ Prov 21:13 cf Isa 33:15 ; also of adder in simile of wicked Psa 58:5 אָזְנוֺ יַאְטֵם חֵרֵשׁ פֶתֶן כְּמוֺ ; א ׳מֵסִיר מִןֿ Prov 28:9 so א ׳עֲרֵלָה their ear is uncircumcised Jer 6:10 ; א ׳הִכְּבִּיד Zech 7:11 compare Isa 48:8 ; Jer 5:21 ; Ezek 12:2 ; compare also Isa 42:20 . b. of Yahweh , ׳בְּא ׳י after verb of utterance Num 11:18 (J) 14:28 (P) 1Sam 8:21 ; Ezek 8:18 ; after עָלָה 2Kin 19:28 = Isa 37:29 ; after בּוֺא Psa 18:7 compare 2Sam 22:7 where verb omitted; so also (after noun without verb) Num 11:1 (J) ׳בְּא ׳י 1Chr 28:8 nearly = in presence of; incline the ear א ׳הִטָּה 2Kin 19:16 = Isa 37:17 ; Dan 9:18 ; Psa 86:1 ; followed by לְ 17:6 ; 88:3 ; 116:2 ; followed by אֶלֿ 31:3 ; 71:2 ; 102:3 ; א ׳הִקְשִׁיב 10:17 ; א לְ ׳קַשֻּׁבוֺת 2Chr 6:40 ; 7:1